<title>MALAYSIA: Hong Leong Industries 6-mth net up 6 pct.</title>
<headline>Hong Leong Industries 6-mth net up 6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)     30.3     vs	28.6</p>
<p>    Net profit		 59.45    vs	56.13</p>
<p>    Turnover		1,170.87    vs   1,040.09</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  117.84    vs     118.08</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less  48.27    vs less 44.31</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries  less   1.43    vs less  2.78</p>
<p>    Dividend   (pct)	 10.0     vs	10.0</p>
<p>Note - Hong Leong Industries Bhd is involved in investment holding, and makes mosaic and ceramic tiles.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
